+---
+id: op-qftx-clay-4d-yang-mills-existence-mass-gap
+kind: open-problem
+title: Four-dimensional Yang–Mills existence and mass gap
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-yang-mills-clay-problem
+dependency_level: 0
