+---
+id: ex-qftx-clay-two-global-forms-same-algebra
+kind: example
+title: Two global forms with the same simple Lie algebra
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+page: qftx-yang-mills-clay-problem-examples
+dependency_level: 0
